               --------------------------------------------
                 LOGVUE, v1.0c (05-Jan-96)  by Adolescent



INFO:

   This is just a better way to view logs than the standard LA, LC, LU, etc
   way CNet/3 makes you do it.   It is only one file, but, you can edit the   
   colors, etc by loading the LVUE.REXX file into your fave text editor and
   changing the C.x variables at the start.  (make sure you keep the colors
   as double digit numbers ie. 04=blue)


INSTALLATION:

   1) Copy the LVUE.REXX file to wherever you want it.  (I have mine in the
      pfiles:1oo/logvue/ dir so I don't lose it...)

   2) Load CNET:BBSMENU into a text editor  (make sure you don't use a word
      processor unless you like trouble!)

   3) Add a line at the end of 2; AVAILABLE EVERYWHERE that looks like this

         LOG   `25-  |#0pfiles:1oo/logvue/lvue.rexx}

               ^ this is the symbol under the ESC key, the value is the min
                 access level you need to view the logs.   (also note there
                 is a value for being able to DELETE logs inside the proggy

   NOTE:  You can also put the line under 1; MAINTENANCE MENU so only users
          with maint access can use it...  (I don't give some of my fileops
          the maint pw so I have it in 2...)

   4) Reload BBSTEXT/BBSMENU and type LOG at any prompt...

   5) Edit the LVUE.REXX file and change the dir, color, and access if your
      not liking the way it looks, works, etc...


DISCLAIMER:

   If this program blows up your Amiga, you must have installed it wrong...

   Leave all nasty comments to adoles@netvoyage.net or straight to >NIL:

